{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-post-js","path":"/browser-3-event-loop/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Overblog","author":"zitup"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"ab478fc5-22a5-5214-93d3-929587f16389","html":"<h2 id=\"event-loop\"><a href=\"#event-loop\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Event Loop</h2>\n<p>事件循环是一个无限循环，每当有新事件触发时，就进入这个循环。</p>\n<p>浏览器事件循环是以浏览器为宿主环境实现的事件调度，操作顺序如下：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>执行一个任务</li>\n<li>执行过程中如果遇到 promise 等微任务，就将它加入到微任务队列，如果遇到其它非同步代码，浏览器会在需要执行它们时，将它们加入任务队列，等待下一次循环</li>\n<li>当前任务执行完毕后，立即执行当前微任务队列中的所有微任务（依次执行）。如果微任务中还有微任务，将继续放入微任务队列，它们将全部执行，直到微任务队列清空</li>\n<li>当前任务执行完毕，开始检查渲染，然后渲染线程接管进行渲染</li>\n<li>渲染完毕后，JS 线程继续接管，开始下一个循环</li>\n</ol>\n<p>伪代码实现：</p>\n<p>\n  <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/overblog/static/2ff589686c80afc4caa3af256a756c29/ad997/event-loop.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n  \n  <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n    style=\"position: relative; display: block;  max-width: 590px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"\n  >\n    <span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n      style=\"padding-bottom: 50.67567567567568%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n    >\n      <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; margin: 0; vertical-align: middle; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; box-shadow: inset 0px 0px 0px 400px white;\"\n        alt=\"event loop\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/overblog/static/2ff589686c80afc4caa3af256a756c29/fcda8/event-loop.png\"\n        srcset=\"/overblog/static/2ff589686c80afc4caa3af256a756c29/12f09/event-loop.png 148w,\n/overblog/static/2ff589686c80afc4caa3af256a756c29/e4a3f/event-loop.png 295w,\n/overblog/static/2ff589686c80afc4caa3af256a756c29/fcda8/event-loop.png 590w,\n/overblog/static/2ff589686c80afc4caa3af256a756c29/efc66/event-loop.png 885w,\n/overblog/static/2ff589686c80afc4caa3af256a756c29/ad997/event-loop.png 1012w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 590px) 100vw, 590px\"\n      />\n    </span>\n  </span>\n  \n  </a>\n    </p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>图片来源： <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=u1kqx6AenYw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">JSConf EU 2018</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>另一个示意图：</p>\n<p><img src=\"/overblog/9824eb2d0f47f368a46bc444d0fb6106/event-loop2.gif\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>JS 块表示当前的执行栈</li>\n<li>WebAPIs 表示处理 webApi 代码，当同步代码中碰到 ajax，setTimeout 等操作，会将它们放入这里（这部分包含定时器线程、事件线程、http请求线程等），然后在需要执行回调时，放入任务队列</li>\n<li>Callback Queue 表示任务队列，在执行栈空时，选择第一个任务执行</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>图片来源： <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8aGhZQkoFbQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">JSConf EU 2014</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>微任务包含：Promises, queueMicrotask, MutationObserver</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么需要事件循环\"><a href=\"#%E4%B8%BA%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E5%BE%AA%E7%8E%AF\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>为什么需要事件循环</h2>\n<p>JS 执行是单线程，如果异步操作阻塞了 JS 的执行，会造成<strong>浏览器假死</strong>，影响其它线程（主要是 GUI 渲染线程）的执行。事件循环引入的事件队列，使得异步任务可以非阻塞的执行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"node-中的事件循环\"><a href=\"#node-%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E5%BE%AA%E7%8E%AF\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Node 中的事件循环</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://nodejs.org/en/docs/guides/event-loop-timers-and-nexttick/#what-is-the-event-loop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://nodejs.org/en/docs/guides/event-loop-timers-and-nexttick/#what-is-the-event-loop</a></p>","timeToRead":2,"frontmatter":{"title":"浏览器事件循环","date":"January 22, 2022","spoiler":"浏览器事件循环","cta":"JS"},"fields":{"slug":"/browser-3-event-loop/","langKey":"en"}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/browser-3-event-loop/","previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/engineering-3-babel/","langKey":"en","directoryName":"engineering-3-babel"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Babel"}},"next":{"fields":{"slug":"/react-router-upgrade-to-v6/","langKey":"en","directoryName":"react-router-upgrade-to-v6"},"frontmatter":{"title":"React Router 👉 V6"}},"translations":[],"translatedLinks":[]}},"staticQueryHashes":["708209134"]}